---
//Slider css
import "@splidejs/splide/css/sea-green";

//import icons
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

//image compression
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import woman1 from "../../images/people/woman1.jpg";
import woman2 from "../../images/people/woman2.jpg";
import woman3 from "../../images/people/woman3.jpg";
import woman4 from "../../images/people/woman4.jpg";
---

<div class="wrapper center">
  <div class="">
    <p class="txt-label upper txt-center clr-prim-acc padb-400">
      što kažu drugi
    </p>
    <h2 class="h2 txt-center padb-800">
      Naši klijenti <span class="italic clr-prim-acc">o nama</span>
    </h2>
  </div>
  <section class="center wrapper">
    <div class="splide wrapper center" aria-label="Splide Basic HTML Example">
      <div class="splide__track">
        <ul class="splide__list">
          <!--  Tesitominal 1 -->
          <li class="splide__slide">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="box">
                <div class="image">
                  <Image
                    src={woman1}
                    alt="woman portrait"
                    format="webp"
                    loading="eager"
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="content">
                  <div class="stars">
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="text">
                    <div class="body-bold padb-200">Marina Jabuka</div>
                    <p class="body-large">
                      Zorana je perfekcionist. Osoba koja je svojim okom za
                      detalje uspjela naš stan dovesti do savršenstva te
                      nadmašila sve prvopostojeće vizije i ideje.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!--  Tesitominal 2 -->
          <li class="splide__slide">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="box">
                <div class="image">
                  <Image
                    src={woman2}
                    alt="woman portrait"
                    format="webp"
                    loading="eager"
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="content">
                  <div class="stars">
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="text">
                    <div class="body-bold padb-200">Katarina Topić</div>
                    <p class="body-large">
                      Zorana je preuređenje našeg stana odradila brzo i
                      profesionalno, te nam ostavila savršeno udobnu zonu
                      komfora i sigurnosti. Za svaku pohvalu i preporuku!
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!--  Tesitominal 3 -->
          <li class="splide__slide">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="box">
                <div class="image">
                  <Image
                    src={woman3}
                    alt="woman portrait"
                    format="webp"
                    loading="eager"
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="content">
                  <div class="stars">
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="text">
                    <div class="body-bold padb-200">Marina Perica</div>
                    <p class="body-large">
                      Zorana izvrsno sagledava prostor. Njena vizualizacija i
                      "nit" koja se provlači kroz detalje rezultirali su
                      skladnom i povezanom cjelinom. Pedantno je bilježila sve
                      moje estetske i funkcionalne zahtjeve i realizirala ih.
                      Odlična komunikacija od pripreme do završetka radova!
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>

          <!--  Tesitominal 4 -->
          <li class="splide__slide">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="box">
                <div class="image">
                  <Image
                    src={woman4}
                    alt="woman portrait"
                    format="webp"
                    loading="eager"
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="content">
                  <div class="stars">
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                    <Icon name="star" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="text">
                    <div class="body-bold padb-200">Tena Crnjac</div>
                    <p class="body-large">
                      Izvrsna suradnja. Brzi i jednostavni dogovori. Sve želje
                      se približe slikom i postanu realnost.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
